* Parallelism: monitor a display while composing a spoken response.
Goal: Monitor a system and respond
. Goal: Monitor display
.. Also: Watch status display as visual
... Look at <status display>
... Verify <status display> is normal
. Goal: Prepare response
.. Also: Prepare spoken response as speech
... Think of <response>
... Say <response>
. Goal: Acknowledge completion
.. Hear <acknowledgement>
.. Verify task is complete
